# 第14章 组合优化
## 14.1 贪心策略的组合优化
```java
// 旅行商问题（TSP）- 贪心近似
public class TSP {
    public int solveGreedy(int[][] dist) {
        int n = dist.length;
        boolean[] visited = new boolean[n];
        visited[0] = true;
        int sum = 0, curr = 0;
        for (int i = 1; i < n; i++) {
            int next = -1, minDist = Integer.MAX_VALUE;
            for (int j = 0; j < n; j++) {
                if (!visited[j] && dist[curr][j] < minDist) {
                    minDist = dist[curr][j];
                    next = j;
                }
            }
            visited[next] = true;
            sum += minDist;
            curr = next;
        }
        sum += dist[curr][0];
        return sum;
    }
}
```
## 14.2 近似算法
```java
// 集合覆盖 - 贪心近似算法
public class SetCover {
    public Set<Integer> greedyCover(Set<Set<Integer>> sets, Set<Integer> universe) {
        Set<Integer> result = new HashSet<>();
        Set<Integer> covered = new HashSet<>();
        while (!covered.containsAll(universe)) {
            Set<Integer> best = null;
            int maxNew = 0;
            for (Set<Integer> s : sets) {
                Set<Integer> newCover = new HashSet<>(s);
                newCover.removeAll(covered);
                if (newCover.size() > maxNew) {
                    maxNew = newCover.size();
                    best = s;
                }
            }
            if (best == null) break;
            result.add(best.hashCode());
            covered.addAll(best);
        }
        return result;
    }
}
```
## 14.3 启发式算法
```java
// 模拟退火 - 旅行商问题
public class SimulatedAnnealingTSP {
    private static final double INITIAL_TEMP = 10000;
    private static final double COOLING_RATE = 0.999;
    private static final double MIN_TEMP = 1;

    public int[] solve(int[][] dist) {
        int n = dist.length;
        int[] current = new int[n];
        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) current[i] = i;
        int[] best = current.clone();
        double temp = INITIAL_TEMP;

        while (temp > MIN_TEMP) {
            int[] next = generateNeighbor(current);
            double currentCost = cost(current, dist);
            double nextCost = cost(next, dist);
            double delta = nextCost - currentCost;

            if (delta < 0 || Math.random() < Math.exp(-delta / temp)) {
                current = next;
                if (nextCost < cost(best, dist)) best = current.clone();
            }
            temp *= COOLING_RATE;
        }
        return best;
    }

    private int[] generateNeighbor(int[] path) {
        int[] next = path.clone();
        int i = (int) (Math.random() * path.length);
        int j = (int) (Math.random() * path.length);
        int temp = next[i]; next[i] = next[j]; next[j] = temp;
        return next;
    }

    private double cost(int[] path, int[][] dist) {
        double sum = 0;
        for (int i = 0; i < path.length - 1; i++) {
            sum += dist[path[i]][path[i + 1]];
        }
        return sum + dist[path[path.length - 1]][path[0]];
    }
}
```
## 14.4 本章小结
- 组合优化通常是NP难问题
- 贪心可得到近似解
- 模拟退火、遗传算法等可跳出局部最优
- 实际应用中根据精度要求选择合适方法